**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag` (exact tag match via `tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)`, order preserved):

```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```

**`src/main.rs`** — `list` now scans trailing args for `--tag <TAG>`, validates it has a value, and routes through `filter_by_tag` when present (otherwise lists all). Unknown options are rejected.

